scion: Xbyak reports the fields it emits that hold an absolute address as a relative one (jumps and calls to an
address, [rip + address]) and the immediates of mov reg, imm, through CodeGenerator::relocHook_: dynarmic's code cache
(patches/dynarmic-code-cache.patch) relocates blocks with them.

diff --git a/xbyak/xbyak.h b/xbyak/xbyak.h
